bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=cfaf8f4e3da88ffe9e257a6e13f21b74", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/4c14ba4e/uploads/origins/4ae12689-7edb-4768-a0f8-db36c32f749a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=cfaf8f4e3da88ffe9e257a6e13f21b74, https://si.imgix.net/4c14ba4e/uploads/origins/4ae12689-7edb-4768-a0f8-db36c32f749a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=bd1d4be09f0c075719c1c87bf6abe15b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/4c14ba4e/uploads/origins/4ae12689-7edb-4768-a0f8-db36c32f749a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=05af3be6d979b0e2989c6b8e43d3591d 3x"}, "body": "excessive internal bleeding\n\nIt is a pleasure to meet you, and I apologize for the sudden contact.\nMy name is Sleep Hitoha, and I'm a V-liver on the V-liver distribution platform \"IRIAM\".\n\nI have been looking at your illustrations for a long time, and I would like to request an illustration from you.\n\nIf possible, I would like to ask you to create a new standing picture of the current delivery as much as possible.\nFor the hairstyle, I would like a long wolf cut only around the face with the half twin of the standing picture down, and a dopamine shaped hairpin.\n\nAs for the image, we would like a bunny suit of sequin or aurora material, without a skirt, etc., and a warm jacket with a large silhouette, such as a parka or down jacket (so that the bunny suit can be seen). Tights should be fine net tights (white, black, or any other color) to minimize the area of the skin, but we will leave everything up to you.\n\nWe would like to value the style of the artist first and foremost, so we ask that you check the IRIAM Standing Picture Guide and make your own decision. We have always wanted to work with you, and we promise that we will not make any claims about the operation after delivery.\n\nhttps://webcontents.iriam.app/illustration_guide_v3/\n\nI will also share the standing picture of pupil feather sleep. I hope you can use it as a reference for makeup, etc.\n\nhttps://share.icloud.com/photos/0df0n5-al18X_n4uId1iYfLiw\n\n\nIf it is NG to be used as a standing picture for delivery, we will leave it to you to create a single picture with a faint image of \"pupil feather sleep wearing the original standing picture clothes plus a fluffy down, sipping a can of chu-hai with a straw in a snowy, dimly lit outdoor location (park, street, etc.)\".\n\nThank you very much in advance.\n\nHitoha Sleep (@dopadopa_bunny)", "nc": 161, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@HdRy_7/works/10", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2673521, "client_id": 1305048, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/69aeb230/uploads/origins/0252990d-0ca1-4f37-8070-6b2a00280738?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d29c6de8211f120919abf40ca958db7c", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/69aeb230/uploads/origins/0252990d-0ca1-4f37-8070-6b2a00280738?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d29c6de8211f120919abf40ca958db7c, https://si.imgix.net/69aeb230/uploads/origins/0252990d-0ca1-4f37-8070-6b2a00280738?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=225f6f0609ebd1ca20898b7aa95f589d 2x, https://si.imgix.net/69aeb230/uploads/origins/0252990d-0ca1-4f37-8070-6b2a00280738?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=41c380a9ca69c302c36d574db324d8e0 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/69aeb230/uploads/origins/0252990d-0ca1-4f37-8070-6b2a00280738?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c1d9910257cc11a842292c3cac0155b4", "srcset":